# Build context is web-apps/ (see Dockerfile). Keep host-built artifacts out:
# they're Windows-specific (pnpm junctions, Prisma engines) and rebuilt in the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/src/generated
**/out
**/build

# Secrets: runtime env comes from compose (env_file ../.env), never baked in
**/.env*

**/*.log
**/.vercel
.git
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
docker-compose-*.yml
Makefile
